# The image's build context is only what the Dockerfile copies. Without this
# file, `docker build .` and `docker compose build` send the whole checkout,
# litegen-core/target (tens of GB) and every node_modules included.
# A new COPY in the Dockerfile needs its path allowed here too.
*
!litegen-core/Cargo.toml
!litegen-core/Cargo.lock
!litegen-core/src/
!litegen-core/migrations/
!models/
